// ahoy_harbour_door: the plain wooden door on nine buildings, seven of them in Port Phasmatys and one
// the front door of Burgh de Rott's inn. It carries op1=Open and nothing anywhere answered it, so
// every one of those doors said nothing interesting happens and stayed shut - which walled Melina
// (Making History) into her house and the inn cellar (In Aid of the Myreque) away from the street.
// It has no open-state loc to swap in, so it lets the player through the way the other one-piece
// doors do.
[oploc1,ahoy_harbour_door] ~walk_through_door;
